window.products.push({"id":344006,"name":"Cheese Board Set & Knife Set,Wood Charcuterie Boards,Cheese Tray with Cutlery in Double Slide-Out Drawer,Cheese Plates for Charcuterie,Wine,Crackers, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YzHDxWvyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎁【𝗛𝗶𝗴𝗵 𝗤𝘂𝗮𝗹𝗶𝘁𝘆 𝗔𝗰𝗮𝗰𝗶𝗮 𝗪𝗼𝗼𝗱】 -- This cheese board set is made from high quality Acacia wood that can minimize the wear on both your knives set and the charcuterie board. It will not absorb the smell of food, so your muffins won’t taste like cheese. Our Acacia wood cheese plate is more durable and sturdy than bamboo cheese tray. Not easily out of shape and has a long service life. 👫【𝗔𝘄𝗲𝘀𝗼𝗺𝗲 𝗖𝗵𝗲𝗲𝘀𝗲 𝗕𝗼𝗮𝗿𝗱 𝗦𝗲𝘁】 -- Our cheese board sets come with 4 stainless steel knives, 4 ceramic sauce bowls, 2 small forks, and 2 round tray. Extra 4 ceramic bowls are convenient for full of various sauces you need. The generous size of this cheese plate which comes with a removable double-sided slab in the middle of the cutting surface, allow you to cut all kind of cheese on it and other space can place fruits, dried fruits, nuts, cured meats, olives, crackers. 🎁【𝗗𝗼𝗲𝘀 𝗡𝗼𝘁 𝗜𝗻𝘁𝗲𝗿𝗿𝘂𝗽𝘁 𝗧𝗵𝗲 𝗨𝘀𝗲 𝗼𝗳 𝗧𝗵𝗲 𝗖𝗵𝗲𝗲𝘀𝗲 𝗕𝗼𝗮𝗿𝗱】 -- Seamlessly pull out from the cheese board, It has 2 slotted magnet drawers storage Which is simply stunning and perfect to hold Serving Utensils and Spreaders inside. Stainless Steel Blades comes with easy grip handles. Every cheese board set comes with premium cutting knives that fit perfectly into a slide out drawer. This feature is very unique and makes for simple cleanup. 👫【𝗧𝗵𝗲 𝗜𝗱𝗲𝗮𝗹 𝗢𝗽𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 𝗳𝗼𝗿 𝗣𝗮𝗿𝘁𝗶𝗲𝘀】 -- This charcuterie board is a must when having friends or family over. The grooved serving rim makes it easy to hold crackers or bread and it is big enough to hold all different types of cheese and grapes. It is perfect for entertaining guests. 🎁【𝗨𝗻𝗶𝗾𝘂𝗲 𝗚𝗶𝗳𝘁 𝗖𝗵𝗼𝗶𝗰𝗲】 -- This charcuterie board for Wine, Crackers, Brie, Meat is expertly designed to meet personal and unique is both a passion and a pleasure. The perfect centerpiece for any party and a great gift for any cheese lover! Ideal gift for Mother's Day, Father's day, anniversary, housewarming, party, birthday, Christmas, or any other occasion. A bonus best wishes card at no extra cost! Absolutely anyone would be thrilled to receive this unique and useful gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YzHDxWvyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Atsani","source_asin":"B08KGNZJGT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-344006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KGNZJGT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KGNZJGT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
