window.products.push({"id":344421,"name":"HZDHCLH Kids Learning Alarm Clock for Girls, Silent Small Cute Table Clocks Battery Powered, 4 inch Analog Alarm Clock for Bedrooms (Pink Rabbit)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t+S7qE0ZL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"⏰[KIDS ALARM CLOCK] HZDHCLH's alarm clock has a painted metal frame, which is more robust and durable. Cute cartoon patterns attract children's attention and make them more interested in learning time. Stylish colored hands, Arabic numerals dial display 1 to 60, easier to distinguish and read the time.In the back-to-school season, Children's Day, Thanksgiving season, Christmas and other festivals, it is pefect gift for parents to give their children. ⏰[EASY TO SET ] The buttons on the back of the analog alarm clock are simple to operate, suitable for children, and easier to adjust the time and set the alarm clock. Help children stay away from the temptation of smart devices, cultivate a sense of time, fall asleep at ease, get up on time, and reduce parents' worry about children being late for school. ⏰[SILENT & NON TICKING] The modern alarm clock adopts upgraded silent scanning movement, the sound is less than 15 decibels, and it will not make noise to interfere with kid's rest or study.The 4-inch small alarm clock can be conveniently placed anywhere, and can be used as decorations for bedside tables, desks, shelves, bedrooms, living rooms and so on. ⏰[SOFT NIGHT LIGHT] Press the night light button on the back of the small alarm clock, and the soft light will illuminate the dial, which is not dazzling and saves power, so that children can easily watch the time at night.The soft sound of the alarm clock gently wakes up the child from the dream, allowing the child to get up happily instead of being suddenly awakened by the sound of the alarm clock. ⏰[BATTERY OPERATED] The cute desk clock is powered by AA batteries. Please note that the battery is not included. In order to extend the life of the battery-powered alarm clock, please do not use rechargeable batteries and alkaline batteries.If you have any problems, please contact us, we will give answers and solutions within 24 hours. Happy shopping.There may be a slight color difference due to different monitors and shooting lights.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t+S7qE0ZL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HZDHCLH","source_asin":"B09ZQLL6TT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-344421","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZQLL6TT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZQLL6TT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
