window.products.push({"id":344463,"name":"3Pcs Glass Coffee Canister with Shelf Printed Coffee Bar, Sugar Container, 3x53oz Glass Coffee Bean Storage Jars with Airtight Locking Clamp Lids Spoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h7vRtXP0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Everything You Need: Our coffee canister set includes everything you need to enjoy your coffee in style, including 3 coffee glass containers, a coffee shelf, and 2 wooden spoons. With this set, you'll have everything you need to keep your coffee fresh and easily accessible. Keep Your Coffee Fresh: Our coffee canisters are designed to keep your coffee fresh and flavorful. The airtight glass canisters in our coffee rack set will keep your coffee fresh and flavorful for longer periods of time. The bamboo lids are designed to fit snugly, creating an airtight seal that keeps moisture and air out. [Best material] This coffee shelf is made of high-quality bamboo. After manual polishing, the surface is smooth and the texture is clear. The coffee spoon is made of beech wood, which is hard and has a unique color. It is all made by experienced manual workers. Due to the particularity of beech wood, after a long time of sealed transportation, it will permeate the natural oil of plants, without affecting any beauty and use, It is only adsorbed on the package of the spoon. Unique and Stylish Design: The natural beauty of bamboo shines through in our coffee rack set. Each piece is uniquely crafted by hand, resulting in subtle variations that make each set one-of-a-kind. The sleek glass canisters provide a modern and sophisticated touch, while the bamboo spoons add a rustic charm. Perfect Gift: Our coffee rack set makes the perfect gift for coffee lovers. Whether you're looking for a gift for a friend or family member, or simply looking to treat yourself, this set is the perfect choice. With its elegant design and high-quality materials, this set is sure to impress anyone who loves coffee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h7vRtXP0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ChezMax","source_asin":"B0BZZB278B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-344463","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZZB278B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZZB278B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
