window.products.push({"id":344478,"name":"Dry-erase monthly calendar easily displayed on refrigerator or other surface / Large magnetic white board","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512cM+KEpfL._AC_.jpg","description":"LIFE IS CRAZY BUSY, MAKE SOME SENSE OUT OF IT ALL! USE THIS CALENDAR TO INCREASE YOUR PRODUCTIVITY AND TO CREATE MORE TIME TO DO THE THINGS YOU LOVE - This calendar allows for a 31-day month (no diagonal-divided days), whereas many other calendars do not. - Perfect size: 11.75” x 16”. Whiteboard re-usable magnetic calendar. Ideal size for refrigerator doors. - Every calendar includes two free double-sided stickers on the back……allows your calendar to adhere to non-magnetic surfaces if needed (including non-magnetic refrigerator doors, kitchen cupboard doors, lockers, file cabinets, walls, etc.). - Llots of extra space for notes, reminders, quotes and artwork. -Two free dry-erase markers included: one black marker and one red marker. Each marker has a built-in dry eraser to instantly erase mistakes or change your month! Each marker also has a built-in magnet so it can hang next to your beautiful calendar. SEE YOUR ENTIRE FAMILY’S SCHEDULE AT A GLANCE MOM'S : Keep track of the kid's after-school activities, doctor’s appointments & family fun. STUDENTS: Keep track of upcoming tests & due dates for papers. TEACHERS: Plan for tests, quizzes & PTA meetings. ATHLETES: Plan and track your weekly workouts, monthly workouts and fitness classes. Runners can track mileage and plan training runs for upcoming races. SENIORS: List your volunteer activity dates, babysitting the grandchildren and doctor's appointments. Elation Products offers a 100% money back guarantee..love it or send it back Buy now, at this price, they won’t last long!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512cM+KEpfL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELATION","source_asin":"B01LX9ZSKM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-344478","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LX9ZSKM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LX9ZSKM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
