window.products.push({"id":344696,"name":"CHATEAU HOME COLLECTION 100% Pima Cotton 4-Piece Sheet Set 500 Thread Count 16 inch Deep Pockets (fits Upto 18\" mattresses) Solid Sateen Weave Hotel L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q0W97wXhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LUXURIOUSLY BREATHABLE HOTEL BEDDING COLLECTION SHEETS. These exquisite Pima cotton sheets are thick & soft and have that luxurious hotel feel that only comes with the high thread count fabric crafted from the finest 100% Pima cotton yarns. These cotton sheets are closely woven, keeping your comfort in mind and gets softer with each wash. OUR USP-100% Cotton Sheets. We specialize in manufacturing the softest and luxurious sheets including our best seller 100% Pima Cotton sheets HIGHEST QUALITY BEST COTTON SHEETS New & Improved Version: If you love the feel of luxurious hotel sheets & crisp pillowcases, you'll adore our 500 thread count Pima Cotton sheets. We use fine yarns made with 100% long staple cotton fiber & a gorgeous sateen weave. Our sheets get softer with each wash, lifetime softness, resist fading, and they’re incredibly eco-friendly. Premium cotton yarns ensure sheets of the utmost comfort with detailed hem styling. CLASSIC TAILORED LOOK WITH DEEP POCKETS: Queen Size Luxury 4-Piece Bed Sheets Set -Flat sheet & pillowcases come with a tailored marrow stitch for a hotel bedding collection look. Each set includes 1 Flat Sheet, 90\" x 102\"; 1 Fully Elasticized Fitted Sheet, 60\" x 80\" with 16 inch deep pockets (fits upto 18 inch mattresses); and 2 Standard Pillowcases, 20\" x 30\". Our Deep Pocket fitted sheet feature Smart Head/ Foot Tag to indicate the width side of the fitted sheet for ease of use. CERTIFIED STANDARD 100 BY OEKO-TEX - Your new sheets are tested thoroughly to ensure the utmost safety and comfort. Every inch of our fabric meets top performance standards for shrinkage, color fastness, strength, and thread count. Extensive product checks and ongoing audits ensure sustainability. Each piece of fabric is measured individually, and each linen is stitched to perfection. Before packaging, we inspect each piece individually to ensure it is flawless. BETTER EXPERIENCE – An Exquisite 500 thread count sheet set crafted from the finest cotton yarns. Our products are backed by incredible customer service. We are dedicated to ensuring you have an excellent experience, from the moment you place your order until you sleep on your new bedding the first time. ORDER NOW, risk-free. Our designs match any décor and are a wonderful gift idea for men and women, Moms and Dads, Valentine's, Mother's Day, Father's Day, and Christmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q0W97wXhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHATEAU HOME COLLECTION","source_asin":"B06XTN1GK7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-344696","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XTN1GK7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XTN1GK7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
