window.products.push({"id":344723,"name":"Silicone Cooking Utensils Set for Kitchen: 7 Piece Red Silicone Kitchen Utensil Set - BPA Free Heat Resistant Non Stick Silicone Tools with Wooden Han","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8154ljlqU4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"7 PIECE SET  This stylish silicone utensil set from Bevy Luxe has every tool you need to cook and serve a delicious homemade meal. Thef silicone utensils are as useful as they are classy, and are sure to win you compliments from your dinner guests. The set includes a spatula, tongs, pasta server, serving spoon, deep ladle, whisk, and strainer.   FOOD SAFE SILICONE  What you use to prepare your meal is just as important as the ingredients within it. BPA free silicone is a hypoallergenic alternative to other nonstick cookware. The nonporous surface is inert, which means the silicone does not retain bacteria, odors, or stains. Keep your nonstick pots and pans scratch-free with our flexible, rounded silicone utensils. Prepare food that is both hygienic and scrumptious with food safe silicone utensils.   WOOD HANDLES  Whisk eggs, flip pancakes, and serve pasta without losing your grip or burning your hand, thanks to the comfortable wooden handles. The ergonomic shape and smooth wood feel good in your hand even after a marathon baking session. Each handle has a hole drilled through the end for easy hanging. Our durable silicone and solid wood utensils will last through years of delicious family meals.   TEMPERATURE RESISTANT  BPA free silicone has a high temperature tolerance. Our kitchen set can withstand from -22 up to 470 degrees Fahrenheit (-30 to 243 degrees Celsius) without warping, melting, or bending. Throw dirty utensils into the dishwasher for an easy clean. Grillmasters should avoid putting the utensils in open flames.   KITCHEN ESSENTIALS  Surprise new home owners, avid cooks, and college students with a complete kitchen utensil set that includes everything they need to mix, scrape, saute, decorate, toss, strain and decorate. The nontoxic silicone is a long-lasting, eco-friendly alternative to rubber and plastic. Cook like a master chef with a silicone kitchen set from Bevy Luxe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8154ljlqU4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bevy Luxe","source_asin":"B07BSVGJD5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-344723","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BSVGJD5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BSVGJD5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
