window.products.push({"id":344848,"name":"Cute Tools Grater - Culinary Chef Tested For Daily Use, Durable Stainless Steel Zester And Grater, Prepare Food With This Heavy Duty Kitchen Utensil, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41UvDoYoCAL._AC_.jpg","description":"That big, boxy grater in the kitchen drawer has it's place. But this little number takes grating to the next level. It's smaller, sleeker and perfectly appropriate for the serving table. Grate hard cheeses directly over pasta, or grate hard spices into sauces at the stove. Art For A Cause produces a unique line of beautiful, quality, hand painted tools for the home, kitchen and garden called CuteTools! Each top-quality steel product is hand painted in one of several proprietary designs to become fun and functional pieces of art. The company has engaged the community by employing individuals with special needs such as cerebral palsy, muscular dystrophy, multiple scleroses and other cognitive challenges. The tools are sanded, primed, decoratively painted, and packaged. In addition to the social responsibility the company embraces, CuteTools arrive in attractive, unique sustainable packaging which encourages recycling and environmental responsibility. Each tool comes in a corrugated cardboard box which slides into a PVC outer sleeve to allow clear visibility of the product. Tucked inside is a package of basil seeds, filled and packed by the special needs students. The seed packets encourage consumers to utilize the cardboard as the medium for growing the seeds. Instructions for creating a \"mini-greenhouse\" are printed on each packet along with the company's mission statement, \"A company which strives to promote an improved work ethic for the preservation of our planet and its people. Plant a seed. Make a difference.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41UvDoYoCAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CuteTools!","source_asin":"B007KE0M98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-344848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007KE0M98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007KE0M98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
