window.products.push({"id":344854,"name":"SUPERIOR Zigzag Collection Area Rug, 8mm Pile Height with Jute Backing, Designer Inspired Ikat Chevron Pattern, Fashionable and Affordable Woven Rugs ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yT5H0Tr8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Affordable Luxury Rugs Superior is delighted to introduce our gorgeous Zigzag Area Rug. The fashionable bold zigzag pattern features a distressed global flair for a show-stopping bold look in any room. The versatile colors and stylish ikat effect make this rug a fine choice for a vintage, global, bohemian, or shabby chic look. The Zigzag rug collection includes two color palettes to choose from: Brown with beige, grey, green, and black gray hues, or Red with sage, gold, grey, and black. Woven and crafted for strength and durability in 100 percent polypropylene fibers, this rug collection has the beauty and suppleness of a traditional pile that is altogether practical, durable, and colorful. The 8mm pile height has a comfy feel and can also hold up to high traffic areas in your home. This degree of excellence at our affordable price defines outstanding value. Liven up or complement your décor and fine floors in the foyer or entry way, back door, living room, dining room, kitchen, in front of the fireplace, hallways and bedrooms.With over 200 designs available, Superior offers the most attractive area rugs for infinite decorating possibilities. Available array of various sizes, colors and patterns make decorating floors easy, entertaining, and enjoyable. Vacuum regularly to maintain the quality durability of this fine fabric. Our breathtaking selections are guaranteed to impress your guests, family members and friends. Heritage We have been manufacturing fine home goods for over 40 years. We make everything from area rugs and decorative bedding, to sheets, duvets, pillowcases, and bed skirts, towels and bath robes, and comforters and mattress toppers. Our wide range of colors, patterns, and price points ensures that every one of our customers will be able to find something they'll love. We are experts in manufacturing high quality textiles and pride ourselves on only producing the finest products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yT5H0Tr8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPERIOR","source_asin":"B0768JDPG1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-344854","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0768JDPG1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0768JDPG1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
